# Shared build context for log-worker/, claude-worker/ and cs-worker/ Dockerfiles.
# Only worker-sdk + the workers are COPYed, so exclude everything else to keep the
# context small — and NEVER bake credentials into an image.
*

!worker-sdk/
!claude-worker/
!log-worker/
!cs-worker/

# ...but still drop noise from inside the dirs we keep.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.git/
**/*.log
claude-worker/claude-worker-trace.log

# Credentials must come from env at RUNTIME (compose env_file), never from the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*secrets*.json
